      "message": "fix(verify): a raw-stock-only mark holds only while its model prints the same\n\nThird review of PR #1097: DeleteFixture removed a marked model without\ndropping its mark, the fourth command that had to remember. The mark\nnow carries a 128-bit fingerprint of the source model's geometry as\nthe verdict reads it (facet count, local vertex bits, placement bits;\nFNV-1a and splitmix64 lanes, memoised per revision), and stock_source\nhonours it only while a model of that name is the stock's source and\nprints the same; any mismatch voids it with a named note on the\ngate's visible line. The project file saves the print beside the\nflag; a flag without one loads unmarked with a note. DeleteFixture\ngains the tidiness drop the other removers have.\n\nFixes #1094\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
